      <note>WF-load_map
Prepares the CDM load: person and visit ids (kept between runs), unit mappings, the codes in use,
their mapping to standard concepts, ambiguous lab codes.
First empties the tables it rebuilds (not map.person_map and map.visit_map) and adm.map_load_reject.</note>
